            "speaker_id": 24897,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, let's kick off the 'Launch of Hybrid Retail Investment Corner' project. The main goal is to get this operational in 21 days. First step is to align on the product offering. I've created a draft product list in A1 based on our retail strategy. Please review and provide feedback so we can finalize T1.",
