            "msg_id": "M4",
            "speaker_id": 17558,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "The catalogue looks good. Just one question on the 'Global Tech Titans' fund in A1 - will we have a one-page summary for this? It's a bit more complex than the others and customers will likely ask for something to take away.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
