          {
            "msg_id": "M7",
            "speaker_id": 24897,
            "reply_to": "M6",
            "text": "Good question, 89356. We'll need a separate accounting process for this. Task T5 is for you to define the specific chart of accounts. For daily performance, we'll use the tracker A3. Let's use this opportunity to define what we want to measure. I propose we track: 1. Total investment value, 2. Number of new leads generated, and 3. Average investment per customer.",
            "mentions": [
              89356
