            "speaker_id": 24897,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "Thanks 89356. I've reviewed A5. It covers the new GL codes, which is good. However, it's missing the end-of-day reconciliation process between the sales recorded in the tracker A3 and the amounts settled. We need to define those steps clearly to ensure accuracy from day one.",
            "mentions": [
              89356
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5",
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 556038,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "Good point from 24897. Also, looking at the related reporting tasks T7 and T12, we should ensure the structure of the daily tracker A3 and the weekly review template A8 are aligned. For A8, can we add a section for qualitative feedback from the sales team? It's important to capture more than just numbers.",
            "mentions": [
              24897
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T7",
              "T12",
              "A3",
              "A8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M47",
            "speaker_id": 89356,
            "reply_to": "M45",
            "text": "What do you mean by reconciliation process? The store already does a cash out.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 24897,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "Because these are financial products, the settlement can be different. We need a step where someone (likely from your team) verifies that every sale in A3 matches a transaction in the banking system, and investigates any discrepancies. It's a key control. Please add a section in A5 describing this daily check.",
            "mentions": [
              89356
